<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Restoration Druid Healer</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-restoration-druid-healer">Head for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>There's only one 359 pre-raid option here, and it's the Engi goggles. They are BoP, so you must have the profession to craft them. While on first glance they look like they're missing stats, the Cogwheel "sockets" are actually the equivalent of the secondary stats that are essentially mix and match. Additionally, for some reason, they're slightly overitemized for a 359, meaning that they will be better than all other 359s.<br/>
<br/>If you don't have Engineering or can't afford the helm, there are only a few 346 helm options, so all of them have been listed in no particular order.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, Revered <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
