<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-restoration-druid-healer">Shoulders for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>There are no 359 options in this slot whatsoever. Interestingly, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57866/mantle-of-soft-shadows">
<img alt="Mantle of Soft Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_152.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Soft Shadows</span></a> has slightly higher Intellect than the other two 346 options due to the added socket. If you don't need haste from your shoulder slot, it's a decent option.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86403/felfire-inscription">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Felfire Inscription</span></a> (Inscription) &gt; <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, Exalted <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
