<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-restoration-druid-healer">Back for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>There are multiple 359 pre-raid items available for this slot, but one of them is an extremely rare world drop and the other two are Valor Point purchases only. In general it would be recommended to use a 346 for this slot until you have a lot of VP left over.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75172/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> (Tailoring) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a> <b>+</b> <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=39300/spring-loaded-cloak-expander">
<img alt="Spring Loaded Cloak Expander" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spring Loaded Cloak Expander</span></a> (Engineering)<div class="pad"></div>
