<span class="tinyicontxt">Grim Batol</span></a> (H)</td></tr></tbody></table>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-restoration-druid-healer">Chest for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>In Phase 1 of Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode (359) version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs, so this is one of those slots. Upgrading to the heroic (372) version will require the normal mode base item. However, this slot also has the crafted LW chest, which is relatively very cheap, so it's generally recommended to use that for a while first especially as the chest is quite expensive. There is also a pretty good JP option instead if you don't want to buy the tier chest or the LW chest.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74191/enchant-chest-mighty-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Mighty Stats</span></a> (budget)<div class="pad"></div>
