<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-restoration-druid-healer">Hands for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>In Phase 1 of Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode (359) version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs, so this is one of those slots. Upgrading to the heroic (372) version will require the normal mode base item. It's also the only 359 preraid option for this slot, unfortunately; it is pretty well itemized though.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
