<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-restoration-druid-healer">Waist for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Two great 359 options here and they're both easy to obtain! They're almost identical in stats, so it's almost like a "time to farm rep" vs "money to buy the craft" comparison here. It's highly recommended to pick either of these belts up as they'll be really easy to get, and they're itemized great too.<div class="pad"></div>
