<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-restoration-druid-healer">Legs for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>In Phase 1 of Cataclysm, you must purchase the normal mode (359) version of the tier chest/<wbr/>gloves/<wbr/>legs, so this is one of those slots. Upgrading to the heroic (372) version will require the normal mode base item. Unfortunately, they're the only 359 preraid option in this slot and they're quite expensive.<br/>
<br/>If you offspec Balance and this slot would not complete any set bonuses for Resto, consider using the Balance tierset legs instead as they have slightly better itemization. That being said, you should not use the Balance legs if they would cost you either the 2pc or 4pc set bonus, nor should you go out of your way to buy it unless you absolutely don't need to spend VP on anything else. For this reason, they have been omitted from this list.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54450/powerful-ghostly-spellthread">
