<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-restoration-druid-healer">Feet for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>There's only one 359 option in this slot, though it's from Valor. However, the interesting quirk is that the Valor boots are BoE, so it's possible they will be purchaseable on your server (though likely VERY expensive) as soon as week 2.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
