<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-restoration-druid-healer">Trinkets for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>T11 trinkets are in a weird place where the gap is very large. For brevity's sake, we have compressed the list to the top 359 epic trinkets, and then a couple non-359 standout trinkets. However, be aware that practically every 346 or lower trinket is much much worse than any trinket listed here (and a few like Mandala/<wbr/>Tear of Blood are really easily obtainable) so you really should just avoid those.<br/>
<br/>As a brief overview:<br/>
<br/>Doll - Extremely good, essentially our top 2 BiS for the entire phase (including raid trinkets)<br/>Tsunami - Very good, better than all but the heroic raid trinkets<br/>Alch Stone - Very close to Tsunami, overtakes it on fights shorter than ~5 minutes<br/>Mandala - While on paper very good and roughly equivalent to Tsunami/<wbr/>Stone, in practice not so great because of the nature of the massive Int proc<br/>Core of Ripeness - Roughly equal to Alch Stone<br/>
<br/>Tear of Blood - Way better than any of the other 346 trinkets, essentially just slightly worse than Stone.<br/>Talisman of Sinister Order - Mostly just decent because of the large amount of Int present.<div class="pad"></div>
