<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Restoration Druid Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staff-weapons-for-restoration-druid-healer">Staff Weapons for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Hope you aren't tired of Archaeology, because it's back with a vengeance. Both our 359 options here are from either Dwarf or Tol'vir Archaeology. Either are basically equally good, though you might slightly prefer the spirit for early progression.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind if you aren't looking to do Archaeology, an equal ilvl one-handed weapon + offhand has slightly better stats than a staff. This will hold true for all of Cataclysm (note that even with a slightly lower ilvl offhand, the 1h+oh combo will generally be better than an equal ilvl staff as long as the mainhand is the same ilvl).<br/>
<br/>
