<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-restoration-druid-healer">Main Hand Weapons for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>There are no pre-raid 359 1h options available for us. However, keep in mind if you aren't looking to do Archaeology, an equal ilvl one-handed weapon + offhand has slightly better stats than a staff. This will hold true for all of Cataclysm (note that even with a slightly lower ilvl offhand, the 1h+oh combo will generally be better than an equal ilvl staff as long as the mainhand is the same ilvl).<br/>
<br/>In other words, if you don't have either Archaeology staff, you should look to use one of these paired with an offhand.<br/>
<br/>
