<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-restoration-druid-healer">Off Hands for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Off-hands change slightly in Cataclysm to not have any spellpower, instead they just make up for the Int/<wbr/>Stam/<wbr/>secondary stat difference that a staff would make. In general, this means that the actual stat value of offhands is much higher than in Wrath - that being said, most of the item budget for caster weapons is still mostly in the weapon itself.<br/>
<br/>Overall this means that even if you have to wear a tier lower of offhand to wear the same ilvl 1h vs a staff, the 1h+oh will have better or at least comparable stats due to the new off-hand enchant. Unfortunately it also means that even if your offhand is a tier higher, it won't make a worse ilvl weapon better or comparable to a staff.<br/>
<br/>For pre-raid, there's actually a 359 available but it's a world drop so will be exceedingly rare. And again, since the weapon ilvl matters most, a 346 mh+359 oh will not be better than 359 staff.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
